post-it: Blue screen of death
cause: Faulty graphics card
symptoms:
	Blue screen
	Restarts by itself
checks:
	yes: Windows starts
	yes: Memory test passes
	no: Stops at "Non-System disk or disk error"
	no: Windows stays up after the desktop appears
	yes: Bluescreen after the desktop appears
		shows: "A fatal exception 0E has occurred", then a reboot 6 s later
	no: Freezes with a buzz after the desktop appears
	yes: CPU fan is clean and spins freely
	yes: Every part sits in its own place
hardware steps:
	Open case
	Trash the GPU
	Fit a new GPU
	Close case
